# Microsoft Teams "Incoming Webhook" URLs, one per line.
#
# How to add a channel:
#   1. In Microsoft Teams, open the channel you want notified of new tasks.
#   2. Channel menu (...) -> Connectors -> Incoming Webhook -> Configure.
#   3. Give it a name (e.g. "Task Bidder") and copy the generated URL.
#   4. Paste that URL on its own line below.
#
# This list is maintained directly by admins by editing this file on the
# server - there is no web UI for it. Copy this file to teams_webhooks.txt
# (drop the .example) and fill in real URLs; that file is gitignored since
# each URL functions like a bearer token for posting into that channel.
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. One task-creation
# notification is sent to every URL listed here.
